<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINALS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S SEMIFINALS.</headline>
<dateline>LINZ, Austria 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the semifinals</p>
<p>of the Austrian Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat 3-Judith Wiesner (Austria)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>4-6 6-3</p>
<p>7-Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat 1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) 7-5 5-7 6-3.</p>
</text>
